      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Transcription Functionality**\n\nI've just finished the `poll_transcription.py` file, incorporating the core functionality. I'm leveraging the `assemblyai` SDK, which should be easily recognizable. I also included a placeholder for the API key, guiding the user to set it as an environment variable or substitute it. I've now defined the function.\n\n\n**Finalizing Transcription Implementation**\n\nI've completed the implementation of `poll_transcription.py`. The `assemblyai` SDK is integrated. An environment variable or direct substitution is suggested for the API key. I defined the `poll_transcription_job` function, which polls the status and returns the transcript. There's also error handling and an example. The task is now complete.\n\n\n",
